# Allowlist only public compilation inputs. In particular, no local tokens,
# ADC credentials, .env files, internal notes, Git history or generated data
# may enter the Docker build context (even the intermediate build stage).
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
!spec/
!spec/**

# Deny accidental secret material even when nested under allowlisted source
# folders. A source-tree secret must never be sent to the builder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
